<title>UK: BGB unit sets 150 bln lire fixed/reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>BGB unit sets 150 bln lire fixed/reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fixed/reverse FRN was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE IRELAND BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BGB GROUP</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN ITL   COUPON   **9.0	 MATURITY    13.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  100.175   PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 ROFFER     98.50 (RECOMMENDED)</p>
<p> NOTES	**FOR YEARS 1-4, THEN 19.5 PCT LESS (2 X 6M LIBOR)</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (M) 10	  LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> SALE LIMS  US/UK/IT/IRL/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
